  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1202.11 Certain Mammalian Proteins Prohibited in Ruminant Feed. Under the authority provided by RSA 435:27, manufacturers of animal feeds shall comply with the regulations prescribing certain mammalian proteins prohibited in ruminant feed as published in Title 21, Code of Federal Regulations, §589.2000-589.2001.\n\nSource. #7054, eff 7-20-99, EXPIRED: 7-20-07\n\nNew. #12487, INTERIM, eff 3-1-18, EXPIRED: 8-28-18\n\nNew. #12788, eff 5-23-19",
